- Add support for new data types and external services dynamically.
- Integrate machine learning models for data trend prediction.
- Develop comprehensive error handling and recovery procedures.
- Ensure multi-tenancy and role-based access control (RBAC).
- Provide detailed logging and monitoring capabilities.

Each of these features will require additional code, configuration management, and testing to ensure the platform is robust, scalable, and resilient under various conditions.']

